# Architecture

- App Router lives in `src/app`. Shared UI is in `src/components`. Server actions are in `src/actions`. Domain logic belongs in `src/lib`, not in large new client components.
- Keep Supabase access in the existing server and `src/lib/supabase` helpers. Do not create a second client pattern.
- Preserve British English in customer-facing copy.
- Return explicit error states from server actions. Do not swallow failures into a success result.
- Do not add a dependency when the repository already has a suitable utility.
- `src/actions/ai.ts` is large. Extend the existing Smart Plan path rather than starting a parallel generator.
- Static monthly conditions are not a live forecast. Wait times are live only when freshness is LIVE.
